		"description": {
			"value": "<p><strong>No Action Cost</strong> - 1 Creature - 1 Round - Magical</p><p>When you use @UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.LkbTss8XzxMinCPZ]{Misty Misdirect}, you can choose to afflict the creature who attacked you.</p><p><strong>[[/save wis]]{Wisdom Save}</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Failure:</strong> Target takes [[/damage 6d6 psychic]] damage and is &amp;reference[frightened] of you.</p></li><li><p><strong>Success:</strong> Half damage, no other effect.</p></li></ul>",
